# Normalise line endings in the repository. Without this the working tree is a mix of CRLF and LF
# (it was 10 files vs 60), and any tool that rewrites a file in passing — sed, a formatter, an
# editor on another OS — silently flips the whole file and buries the real change in the diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary

# Windows-only scripts need CRLF to run.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
